# Project 2 local runtime: python scripts/dev/runtime.py env --run-id my-run
# Private generated config lives in .local/runs/my-run/runtime.env (mode 0600).
# Edit that file before up; repeated env/up preserves configured values/secrets.
# state.json contains public URL, ports, CA/project/env paths and safe Docker selection.
# Every run gets unique images, loopback ports, volumes, queue and buckets.
# down retains data. Run IDs: lowercase letters/digits/hyphens, up to 40 characters.
# Never copy real passwords/tokens into this tracked example.
#
# A healthy common-Git-root .local/lima/d/sock/docker.sock is selected automatically,
# paired with common-root .local/docker. Optional overrides never change global contexts:
# DC2_DOCKER_HOST=unix:///absolute/project/.local/lima/d/sock/docker.sock
# DC2_DOCKER_CONFIG=/absolute/project/.local/docker
# Existing DOCKER_HOST / DOCKER_CONFIG are also respected.
#
# Generated configuration names (values below illustrate interfaces, not credentials):
# DC2_HTTPS_PORT=3443                  # generated free port by default
# DC2_POSTGRES_PORT=55432             # generated free port by default
# DC2_PROCESSING_PORT=58010           # generated free port by default
# MEDIA_PUBLIC_URL=https://localhost:3443
# MEDIA_MINIO_PUBLIC_ENDPOINT=localhost:3443
# MEDIA_MINIO_PUBLIC_USE_SSL=true
# MEDIA_MINIO_USE_SSL=false
# PROCESSING_MINIO_USE_SSL=false
# MEDIA_MINIO_ENDPOINT=minio:9000
# PROCESSING_MINIO_ENDPOINT=minio:9000
# MINIO_REGION=us-east-1
# SOURCE_BUCKET=<unique-project>-source
# OUTPUT_BUCKET=<unique-project>-output
# MEDIA_MINIO_SOURCE_BUCKET=<unique-project>-source
# MEDIA_MINIO_OUTPUT_BUCKET=<unique-project>-output
# PROCESSING_MINIO_OUTPUT_BUCKET=<unique-project>-output
# PROCESSING_QUEUE_NAME=<unique-project>-processing
# MEDIA_POSTGRES_DSN=postgresql+asyncpg://media_runtime:<secret>@postgres:5432/media_db
# MEDIA_MIGRATION_DSN=postgresql+asyncpg://media_migrator:<secret>@postgres:5432/media_db
# PROCESSING_POSTGRES_DSN=postgresql+asyncpg://processing_runtime:<secret>@postgres:5432/processing_db
# PROCESSING_MIGRATION_DSN=postgresql+asyncpg://processing_migrator:<secret>@postgres:5432/processing_db
# PROCESSING_REDIS_URL=redis://:<secret>@redis:6379/0
# MEDIA_PROCESSING_SERVICE_TOKEN and PROCESSING_SERVICE_TOKEN share one generated value.
# SOURCE_SERVICE_TOKEN maps to MEDIA_SOURCE_SERVICE_TOKEN and PROCESSING_SOURCE_SERVICE_TOKEN.
# MEDIA_JWT_SECRET is separate from service tokens.
# MM receives MEDIA_MINIO_ACCESS_KEY/SECRET_KEY (source RW/delete, output read).
# P workers receive PROCESSING_MINIO_ACCESS_KEY/SECRET_KEY (output writes only).
# Cleanup receives CLEANUP_MINIO_ACCESS_KEY/SECRET_KEY (output list/delete only).
# Root MinIO credentials are passed only to MinIO and one-shot bootstrap.
#
# Parent TLS helper creates .local/runs/<id>/tls/{ca.crt,server.crt,server.key}.
# Runtime up invokes scripts/dev/tls.py --run-id <id>; no system trust-store edits.
# HTTPS public API and presigned objects use localhost and the same public port.
# The infrastructure stage serves frontend + /health; /api returns 503 until Media.
# The inherited .env-based stacks are historical; this runtime does not start them.
